			"notes": "### Tactical Immersion Update\n\nThis update focuses on deepening the tactical experience through a complete overhaul of the zoom system, adding high-tier equipment, and enhancing visual feedback across all vision modes.\n\n#### New Features\n- **Tactical Zoom Overhaul**: Implemented dynamic post-processing effects during magnification (vignette tightening, chromatic aberration, digital noise). Added a central HUD Zoom Indicator (up to 3.0x).\n- **Pro Modular Goggles**: New high-tier variant with increased internal capacity for utility modules.\n- **New Utility Modules**: Added Sonar Module (entity detection through walls), Solar Charging Module (passive recovery), and Zoom Module.\n- **New Items and Recipes**: Added crafting recipes for Pro Goggles and all new modules via the Modification Station.\n\n#### Improvements and Fixes\n- **Shader Optimization**: Refined NVG filters, added Thermal pixelation at high zoom, and improved Hydro underwater clarity.\n- **Biometric Scanner Fixes**: Resolved rendering bugs and improved health bar/distance precision.\n- **UI/UX**: Redesigned battery HUD textures and implemented a 'Flip-Up' model state when deactivated.\n- **Safety Reset**: Effects now clear immediately upon unequipping.\n\n#### Technical Changes\n- Updated project versioning to 0.1.3-Alpha.\n- Optimized NBT storage for performance.\n- Refined item tags for Accessories/Curios compatibility."
		},
