			"notes": "This update focuses on localization improvements and item naming refinements for better consistency.\n\nChanges and Improvements:\n * Item Renaming: The \"NVG Battery\" item has been renamed to \"Battery\" across all supported languages.\n * Expanded Regional Support: Added specific localization for the following regions:\n     * Spanish (Mexico): Localization using regional terminology (Lentes).\n     * Spanish (Argentina): Localization using regional terminology (Anteojos) and grammar.\n     * Spanish (Chile): Localization using regional terminology (Antiparras).\n     * English (United Kingdom): British English spelling and terminology.\n     * Russian: Full support for tactical terminology (NVG and Thermal).\n\nInstallation:\n * Download the JAR file corresponding to your mod loader (Fabric or Forge).\n * Requires Architectury API and Cloth Config.\n * Compatible with Accessories (Fabric) and Curios (Forge) for dedicated equipment slots."
