			"notes": "Initial release featuring multi-loader support via the Architectury API.\n\nFeatures:\n * Multi-platform Support: Compatible with both Fabric and Forge for Minecraft 1.20.1.\n * Night Vision Goggles: Provides enhanced visibility in low-light conditions with a green tactical shader overlay.\n * Thermal Goggles: Highlights living entities based on heat signatures, excluding undead mobs.\n * Battery System: Goggles consume energy while active and require Battery items to be recharged.\n * Accessory Integration: Support for dedicated equipment slots (eyes and face) using the Curios API on Forge and the Accessories API on Fabric.\n * Configuration: Includes a configuration menu via Cloth Config to adjust battery durations and recharge items."
